text:
I would spend on something else, because:
- All the bloatware comes with the software;
- OneUI and it's bloatware use 8GB of ram constantly;
- All beta stuff, all everything first comes to Korea, then to USA, then to EU;
- Despite living in Germany and setting all my locales to EN, I see mix of languages (RU + DE + EN) in all different places like in Samsung Members;
- Each "security update" we get monthly or quarterly makes my phone slower, my battery dies faster;
- Phone takes good 5 minutes to come alive after Restart.

I am using Note 10+, and it's being the worst experience since the 1st month of usage.

@Marque 
Do mind sharing your idea/opinion about pros/cons of Samsung 24 Ultra Enterprise version VS the Consumar version.
Thank you so much
